  "title": "人员繁忙程度热力图",
  "content": "<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 1120px; margin: auto; padding: 22px 26px;\"><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin: 0px 0px 5px;\">人员繁忙程度</h1><p class=\"sub\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(117, 131, 152); margin: 0px 0px 18px;\">11 月 30 日—12 月 4 日 · 基于 11 月 26 日周会后排期 · 按总体负载排序</p><div class=\"summary\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 10px; margin: 0px 0px 20px;\"><div class=\"alert\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 0%; background: rgb(255, 241, 239); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; color: rgb(182, 51, 54);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px; margin-right: 7px;\">3 / 6</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(100, 116, 139);\">人超负荷</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 0%; background: rgb(245, 247, 251); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px; margin-right: 7px;\">44 h</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(100, 116, 139);\">超负荷工时合计</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 0%; background: rgb(245, 247, 251); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px; margin-right: 7px;\">95.7%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(100, 116, 139);\">团队整体负载</span></div></div><div class=\"legend\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(100, 116, 139); margin: 0px 0px 12px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><i class=\"room\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 3px; margin-right: 4px; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102);\"></i>有余量 &lt;80%</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><i class=\"busy\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 3px; margin-right: 4px; background: rgb(255, 241, 206); color: rgb(137, 100, 31);\"></i>较满 80–100%</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><i class=\"over\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 3px; margin-right: 4px; background: rgb(255, 225, 204); color: rgb(161, 76, 34);\"></i>超负荷 &gt;100–150%</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><i class=\"critical\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 3px; margin-right: 4px; background: rgb(189, 61, 73); color: white;\"></i>严重超负荷 &gt;150%</span></div><div class=\"scroll\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: auto;\"><table style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-width: 670px; border-spacing: 6px; border-collapse: separate; font-size: 13px;\"><thead style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; color: rgb(102, 118, 138); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0px 4px 6px;\">人员 / 岗位</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 118, 138); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0px 4px 6px;\">客户服务平台</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 118, 138); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0px 4px 6px;\">经营数据看板</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 118, 138); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0px 4px 6px;\">总体负载</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; color: rgb(102, 118, 138); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; padding: 0px 4px 6px;\">已排 / 可用</th></tr></thead><tbody style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; width: 24%; padding: 5px 0px; font-weight: 500;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">王磊</b><small style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(132, 145, 163); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">数据与运维工程师</small></th><td class=\"heat room\" title=\"A-303 生产发布演练 12h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">50.0%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">12 h</span></td><td class=\"heat over\" title=\"B-201 历史数据清洗 24h；B-202 每日同步任务 8h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(255, 225, 204); color: rgb(161, 76, 34);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">133.3%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">32 h</span></td><td class=\"heat total critical\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(189, 61, 73); color: white; outline: rgb(255, 255, 255) solid 1px; outline-offset: -3px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">183.3%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">严重超负荷</span></td><td class=\"hours\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; width: 16%;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">44 / 24 h</b><small class=\"warn\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(189, 61, 73); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">超出 20 h</small></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; width: 24%; padding: 5px 0px; font-weight: 500;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">陈宇</b><small style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(132, 145, 163); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">后端工程师</small></th><td class=\"heat critical\" title=\"A-201 客户接口联调 24h；A-203 权限与审计 28h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(189, 61, 73); color: white;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">162.5%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">52 h</span></td><td class=\"heat room\" title=\"未安排项目工时\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">0.0%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">0 h</span></td><td class=\"heat total critical\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(189, 61, 73); color: white; outline: rgb(255, 255, 255) solid 1px; outline-offset: -3px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">162.5%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">严重超负荷</span></td><td class=\"hours\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; width: 16%;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">52 / 32 h</b><small class=\"warn\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(189, 61, 73); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">超出 20 h</small></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; width: 24%; padding: 5px 0px; font-weight: 500;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">林悦</b><small style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(132, 145, 163); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">前端工程师</small></th><td class=\"heat busy\" title=\"A-202 工单工作台 28h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(255, 241, 206); color: rgb(137, 100, 31);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">87.5%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">28 h</span></td><td class=\"heat room\" title=\"B-203 看板页面适配 8h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">25.0%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">8 h</span></td><td class=\"heat total over\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(255, 225, 204); color: rgb(161, 76, 34); outline: rgb(255, 255, 255) solid 1px; outline-offset: -3px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">112.5%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">超负荷</span></td><td class=\"hours\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; width: 16%;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">36 / 32 h</b><small class=\"warn\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(189, 61, 73); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">超出 4 h</small></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; width: 24%; padding: 5px 0px; font-weight: 500;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">赵敏</b><small style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(132, 145, 163); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">测试工程师</small></th><td class=\"heat room\" title=\"A-301 端到端回归 16h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">50.0%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">16 h</span></td><td class=\"heat room\" title=\"B-301 财务数据对账 8h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">25.0%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">8 h</span></td><td class=\"heat total room\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102); outline: rgb(255, 255, 255) solid 1px; outline-offset: -3px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">75.0%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">有余量</span></td><td class=\"hours\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; width: 16%;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">24 / 32 h</b><small class=\"muted\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(107, 125, 146); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">余量 8 h</small></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; width: 24%; padding: 5px 0px; font-weight: 500;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">周宁</b><small style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(132, 145, 163); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">项目经理</small></th><td class=\"heat room\" title=\"A-104 新增导出需求评估 4h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">12.5%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">4 h</span></td><td class=\"heat room\" title=\"B-101 指标口径确认 4h；B-303 项目验收会 4h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">25.0%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">8 h</span></td><td class=\"heat total room\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102); outline: rgb(255, 255, 255) solid 1px; outline-offset: -3px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">37.5%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">有余量</span></td><td class=\"hours\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; width: 16%;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">12 / 32 h</b><small class=\"muted\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(107, 125, 146); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">余量 20 h</small></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: left; width: 24%; padding: 5px 0px; font-weight: 500;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">何佳</b><small style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(132, 145, 163); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">业务运营</small></th><td class=\"heat room\" title=\"A-302 上线培训材料 4h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">12.5%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">4 h</span></td><td class=\"heat room\" title=\"B-302 使用手册 4h\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">12.5%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">4 h</span></td><td class=\"heat total room\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; padding: 9px 5px; width: 20%; background: rgb(229, 242, 239); color: rgb(38, 116, 102); outline: rgb(255, 255, 255) solid 1px; outline-offset: -3px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.25;\">25.0%</strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11px;\">有余量</span></td><td class=\"hours\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; width: 16%;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12px;\">8 / 32 h</b><small class=\"muted\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; color: rgb(107, 125, 146); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 3px;\">余量 24 h</small></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"footer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 14px 6px 0px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(233, 237, 242); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.65;\"><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">优先协调 · 王磊、陈宇</b><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(100, 116, 139);\">两人各缺 20 小时，林悦缺 4 小时。优先确认数据技能支援、接口交付安排和低优先级事项延期。</p></div><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">可协作 · 何佳、赵敏</b><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(100, 116, 139);\">可支持文档、验收资料和测试准备。人员余量不能直接替代开发或发布能力，调配仍待确认。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(139, 151, 167); line-height: 1.6; margin: 12px 6px 0px;\">负载 = 计划项目工时 ÷ 可用工时；项目列表示占个人容量的比例。可用工时已扣除例行工作与请假，王磊请假 8 小时仅扣一次。团队合计 176 / 184 小时，整体有余量仍可能存在岗位缺口。颜色反映排期负载，不代表实时在线状态；悬停项目色块可查看任务明细。</p></main>"
